   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I Wuz Nothing**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **Dirty Money**: back after 157 archived shows (4490 days); rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **talk (Happy Birthday Gener)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Summer Wind**: back after 340 archived shows (7111 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **encore cheers**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2023-03-17.ck63.flacf** (recommended): source not stated; 34 songs; 150 min [1]\n- **ween2023-03-17**: source not stated; 32 songs; 151 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Microphones were placed on a ten-foot stand in the rear left corner of the floor [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2023-03-17.ck63.flacf**: taped by CPS; source: AKG CK63 > NBob PFA > Sound Devices 744T [1]. Also: Transfer chain: 24-bit 44.1kHz WAV master, converted to 16-bit 44.1kHz WAV, then encoded to FLAC [1]\n- **ween2023-03-17**: taped by Rich Cuiffo; transferred by Rich Cuiffo; source: Schoeps MK41s and Schoeps MK22's> Nbob actives > Sound Devices MixPre 6 II [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Status Serigraph: [2023 Ween - Las Vegas II Silkscreen Concert Poster by Todd Slater](https://www.jojosposters.com/products/2023-ween-las-vegas-ii-silkscreen-concert-poster-by-todd-slater) [4]",
